  "raw": " Altoona, a son of the late Pauline (Sawzykowski) and Joseph F. Gates. Flip attended the Mennonite Central Committee (MCC) and St. Boniface School. He was employed on the construction crew for Stryker Corp. in Altoona, retiring in 2009. Flip enjoyed hunting and trapping and helping friends and family with projects around the farm. He was a longtime member of St. Boniface Church and the American Legion Post 686.\nSurvivors include his wife, Patricia R. Gates, Altoona; a daughter, Heather L. (Tim) McAlister, Altoona; a son, Jason B. Gates, Pittsburgh; a brother, Dennis D. (Dana) Gates, Jefferson, Ohio; a sister, Joan (Dan) Harkness, Altoona; seven granddaughters, Amanda L. McAlister, Abigail S. McAlister, Grace J. McAlister, Emily",
